cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this code, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "schubert-forward-stability: Lean verification of The record statistic and forward stability of Schubert products"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of A. Hardt, R. Hodges, H. Yin, "The record statistic
  and forward stability of Schubert products": the record probabilities of
  uniform, Grassmannian and Boolean permutations (Theorem 1.1), the
  Hardt-Wallach formula for the forward stability of a product of Schubert
  polynomials (1.2), the expectation and limit law of the forward stability for
  independent uniform permutations (Theorem 1.3) and Grassmannian permutations
  (Theorem 1.4), its expectation for Boolean permutations (Theorem 1.5), and the
  corresponding results for backward stability, together with every other
  statement of the paper; its conjectures are stated. Accompanying libraries
  develop finitary permutations and their records, Schubert polynomials over any
  commutative ring, limit theorems for triangular arrays, and strong mixing.
authors:
  - family-names: Hodges
    given-names: Reuven
